#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:2
msgid "How to use Conda as your Python environment"
msgstr "如何使用 Conda 作为 Python 环境"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports Conda as an environment management tool, along with "
"Virtualenv. Conda support is useful for people who depend on C libraries, "
"and need them installed when building their documentation."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持将 Conda 作为环境管理工具，与 Virtualenv 并列。Conda 支持对依赖 C "
"库、需要在构建文档时安装它们的人很有用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:9
msgid ""
"This work was funded by `Clinical Graphics`_ -- many thanks for their "
"support of open source."
msgstr "这项工作由 `Clinical Graphics`_ 资助——非常感谢他们对开源的支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:14
msgid "Activating conda"
msgstr "启用 Conda"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:16
msgid ""
"Conda support is available using a :doc:`../config-file/index`, see :ref"
":`config-file/v2:conda`."
msgstr "Conda 支持通过 :doc:`../config-file/index` 启用，参见 :ref:`config-file/v2:conda` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:18
msgid ""
"Our Docker images use Miniconda, a minimal conda installer. After specifying"
" your project requirements using a conda ``environment.yml`` file, Read the "
"Docs will create the environment (using ``conda env create``) and add the "
"core dependencies needed to build the documentation."
msgstr ""
"我们的 Docker 镜像使用 Miniconda（精简的 conda 安装器）。用 conda ``environment.yml`` "
"文件指定项目依赖后，Read the Docs 会创建环境（使用 ``conda env create`` ）并添加构建文档所需的核心依赖。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:24
msgid "Creating the ``environment.yml``"
msgstr "创建 ``environment.yml``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:26
msgid "There are several ways of `exporting a conda environment`_:"
msgstr "有多种 `exporting a conda environment`_ 方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:28
msgid ""
"``conda env export`` will produce a complete list of all the packages "
"installed in the environment with their exact versions. This is the best "
"option to ensure reproducibility, but can create problems if done from a "
"different operative system than the target machine, in our case Ubuntu "
"Linux."
msgstr ""
"``conda env export`` "
"会生成环境中所有已安装包及其精确版本的完整列表。这是确保可复现的最佳选择，但若在与目标机器不同的操作系统上执行（本例为 Ubuntu "
"Linux）则可能出问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:32
msgid ""
"``conda env export --from-history`` will only include packages that were "
"explicitly requested in the environment, excluding the transitive "
"dependencies. This is the best option to maximize cross-platform "
"compatibility, however it may include packages that are not needed to build "
"your docs."
msgstr ""
"``conda env export --from-history`` "
"只包含环境中显式请求的包，不含传递依赖。这是最大化跨平台兼容性的最佳选择，但可能包含构建文档并不需要的包。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:35
msgid ""
"And finally, you can also write it by hand. This allows you to pick exactly "
"the packages needed to build your docs (which also results in faster builds)"
" and overcomes some limitations in the conda exporting capabilities."
msgstr "最后，你也可以手写该文件。这样能精确挑选构建文档所需的包（同时也能加快构建），并绕过 conda 导出功能的一些限制。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:39
msgid "For example, using the second method for an existing environment:"
msgstr "例如，对现有环境使用第二种方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:55
msgid ""
"Read the Docs will override the ``name`` and ``prefix`` of the environment "
"when creating it, so they can have any value, or not be present at all."
msgstr "Read the Docs 在创建环境时会覆盖其 ``name`` 和 ``prefix`` ，因此它们可以是任意值，甚至完全不出现。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:58
msgid ""
"Bear in mind that ``rasterio==1.2`` (double ``==``) will install version "
"``1.2.0``, whereas ``python=3.8`` (single ``=``) will fetch the latest "
"``3.8.*`` version, which is ``3.8.8`` at the time of writing."
msgstr ""
"请注意 ``rasterio==1.2`` （双 ``==`` ）会安装 ``1.2.0`` 版本，而 ``python=3.8`` （单 ``=`` "
"）会获取最新的 ``3.8.*`` 版本，撰写时为 ``3.8.8`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:66
msgid "Effective use of channels"
msgstr "有效使用 channel"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:68
msgid ""
"Conda packages are usually hosted on https://anaconda.org/, a registration-"
"free artifact archive maintained by Anaconda Inc. Contrary to what happens "
"with the Python Package Index, different users can potentially host the same"
" package in the same repository, each of them using their own *channel*. "
"Therefore, when installing a conda package, conda also needs to know which "
"channels to use, and which ones take precedence."
msgstr ""
"Conda 包通常托管在 https://anaconda.org/，这是 Anaconda Inc. 维护的免注册制品仓库。与 Python "
"包索引不同，不同用户可能在同一仓库中托管同名包，各自使用自己的 *channel* 。因此安装 conda 包时，conda 还需知道使用哪些 "
"channel 以及优先级顺序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:74
msgid ""
"If not specified, conda will use ``defaults``, the channel maintained by "
"Anaconda Inc. and subject to `Anaconda Terms of Service`_. It contains well-"
"tested versions of the most widely used packages. However, some packages are"
" not available on the ``defaults`` channel, and even if they are, they might"
" not be on their latest versions."
msgstr ""
"若未指定，conda 会使用 ``defaults``——由 Anaconda Inc. 维护并受 `Anaconda Terms of "
"Service`_ 约束的 channel。它包含最常用包的充分测试版本。但部分包在 ``defaults`` channel "
"上不可用，即便可用也未必是最新版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:79
msgid ""
"As an alternative, there are channels maintained by the community that have "
"a broader selection of packages and more up-to-date versions of them, the "
"most popular one being ``conda-forge``."
msgstr "作为替代，社区维护的 channel 提供更丰富的包选择和更新的版本，其中最流行的是 ``conda-forge`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:82
msgid ""
"To use the ``conda-forge`` channel when specifying your project "
"dependencies, include it in the list of ``channels`` in ``environment.yml``,"
" and conda will rank them in order of appearance. To maximize compatibility,"
" we recommend putting ``conda-forge`` above ``defaults``:"
msgstr ""
"要在指定项目依赖时使用 ``conda-forge`` channel，请在 ``environment.yml`` 的 ``channels`` "
"列表中包含它，conda 会按出现顺序排列优先级。为最大化兼容性，我们建议将 ``conda-forge`` 放在 ``defaults`` 之上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:96
msgid ""
"If you want to opt out the ``defaults`` channel completely, replace it by "
"``nodefaults`` in the list of channels. See `the relevant conda docs`_ for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"若想完全退出 ``defaults`` channel，可在 channel 列表中用 ``nodefaults`` 替换它。更多信息见 `the "
"relevant conda docs`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:103
msgid "Making builds faster with mamba"
msgstr "用 mamba 加快构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:105
msgid ""
"One important thing to note is that, when enabling the ``conda-forge`` "
"channel, the conda dependency solver requires a large amount of RAM and long"
" solve times. This is `a known issue`_ due to the sheer amount of packages "
"available in conda-forge."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，启用 ``conda-forge`` channel 后，conda 依赖求解器需要大量内存且求解时间长。这是由于 conda-forge"
" 中包数量庞大导致的 `a known issue`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:109
msgid ""
"As an alternative, you can instruct Read the Docs to use mamba_, a drop-in "
"replacement for conda that is much faster and reduces the memory consumption"
" of the dependency solving process."
msgstr "作为替代，你可以指示 Read the Docs 使用 mamba_——它是 conda 的直接替代品，速度快得多且能减少依赖求解过程的内存消耗。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:113
msgid ""
"To do that, add a ``.readthedocs.yaml`` :doc:`configuration file </config-"
"file/v2>` with these contents:"
msgstr "为此，添加内容如下的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` :doc:`配置文件 </config-file/v2>` ："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:116
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:129
msgid ""
"You can read more about the :ref:`config-file/v2:build.tools.python` "
"configuration in our documentation."
msgstr "在我们的文档中可进一步了解 :ref:`config-file/v2:build.tools.python` 配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:136
msgid "Mixing conda and pip packages"
msgstr "混用 conda 和 pip 包"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:138
msgid ""
"There are valid reasons to use pip inside a conda environment: some "
"dependency might not be available yet as a conda package in any channel, or "
"you might want to avoid precompiled binaries entirely. In either case, it is"
" possible to specify the subset of packages that will be installed with pip "
"in the ``environment.yml`` file. For example:"
msgstr ""
"在 conda 环境中使用 pip 有正当理由：某些依赖在所有 channel 中尚无对应的 conda "
"包，或你想完全避免预编译二进制包。这两种情况下都可在 ``environment.yml`` 文件中指定用 pip 安装的包子集。例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:158
msgid ""
"The `conda developers recommend in their best practices`_ to install as many"
" requirements as possible with conda, then use pip to minimize possible "
"conflicts and interoperability issues."
msgstr ""
"`conda developers recommend in their best practices`_ 建议尽量用 conda 安装依赖，再用 "
"pip 尽可能减少冲突和互操作性问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:162
msgid ""
"Notice that ``conda env export --from-history`` does not include packages "
"installed with pip, see `this conda issue`_ for discussion."
msgstr ""
"注意 ``conda env export --from-history`` 不包含用 pip 安装的包，详见 `this conda issue`_ "
"的讨论。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:169
msgid "Compiling your project sources"
msgstr "编译项目源代码"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:171
msgid ""
"If your project contains extension modules written in a compiled language "
"(C, C++, FORTRAN) or server-side JavaScript, you might need special tools to"
" build it from source that are not readily available on our Docker images, "
"such as a suitable compiler, CMake, Node.js, and others."
msgstr ""
"若项目包含用编译型语言（C、C++、FORTRAN）编写的扩展模块或服务端 JavaScript，你可能需要一些从源码构建的专用工具，而我们的 "
"Docker 镜像中并不 readily 提供，例如合适的编译器、CMake、Node.js 等。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:176
msgid ""
"Luckily, conda is a language-agnostic package manager, and many of these "
"development tools are already packaged on ``conda-forge`` or more "
"specialized channels."
msgstr "幸运的是，conda 是与语言无关的包管理器，许多这类开发工具已在 ``conda-forge`` 或更专业的 channel 上打包提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:179
msgid ""
"For example, this conda environment contains the required dependencies to "
"compile `Slycot`_ on Read the Docs:"
msgstr "例如，以下 conda 环境包含在 Read the Docs 上编译 `Slycot`_ 所需的依赖："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:197
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:199
msgid ""
"If you have problems on the environment creation phase, either because the "
"build runs out of memory or time or because some conflicts are found, you "
"can try some of these mitigations:"
msgstr "若在环境创建阶段遇到问题（构建内存或时间耗尽，或发现某些冲突），可尝试以下缓解措施："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:204
msgid ""
"Reduce the number of channels in ``environment.yml``, even leaving ``conda-"
"forge`` only and opting out of the defaults adding ``nodefaults``."
msgstr ""
"减少 ``environment.yml`` 中的 channel 数量，甚至只保留 ``conda-forge`` 并添加 "
"``nodefaults`` 退出默认 channel。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:206
msgid ""
"Constrain the package versions as much as possible to reduce the solution "
"space."
msgstr "尽可能约束包版本以缩小求解空间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:207
msgid ""
":ref:`Use mamba <guides/conda:Making builds faster with mamba>`, an "
"alternative package manager fully compatible with conda packages."
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用 mamba <guides/conda:Making builds faster with mamba>`——与 conda "
"包完全兼容的替代包管理器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:209
msgid ""
"And, if all else fails, :ref:`request more resources <guides/build-using-"
"too-many-resources:Requests more resources>`."
msgstr ""
"若其他方法都无效，:ref:`申请更多资源 <guides/build-using-too-many-resources:Requests more "
"resources>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:213
msgid "Custom Installs"
msgstr "定制安装"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:215
msgid ""
"If you are running a custom installation of Read the Docs, you will need the"
" ``conda`` executable installed somewhere on your ``PATH``. Because of the "
"way ``conda`` works, we can't safely install it as a normal dependency into "
"the normal Python virtualenv."
msgstr ""
"若你运行 Read the Docs 的定制安装，需要在 ``PATH`` 的某个位置安装 ``conda`` 可执行文件。由于 ``conda`` "
"的工作方式，我们无法安全地将其作为普通依赖安装进常规 Python virtualenv。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/conda.rst:220
msgid ""
"Installing conda into a virtualenv will override the ``activate`` script, "
"making it so you can't properly activate that virtualenv anymore."
msgstr "把 conda 安装进 virtualenv 会覆盖 ``activate`` 脚本，导致你无法再正确激活该 virtualenv。"

